Jagruk Brain — BIS Conversational Knowledge & Compliance Assistant

SIH 2026 --- Team Jagruk Swadesh

Jagruk Brain is a multilingual, voice-enabled, Retrieval-Augmented

Generation (RAG) system designed to make Bureau of Indian Standards

(BIS) knowledge easier to search, understand and interact with through a

modern web application.

