  Advanced compliance workflows

  Manufacturer and laboratory search

  Production observability

  Cloud-native scaling

  Role-based access control

  Automated RAG evaluation

  Better model/evidence confidence reporting

Current Repository Notes

This README documents the implementation currently present in the

repository.

Important reproduction notes:

 RAG/index.py contains a Windows-specific dataset path that must be

    changed on another machine.

 API credentials are not included.

 MongoDB requires a user-provided connection string.

 Qdrant must be running and populated before useful RAG queries can

    be answered.

 Running the indexer rebuilds the Qdrant collection.

 The concurrent frontend command uses Uvicorn reload mode; separate

    services are recommended on Windows if reload causes lifecycle

    issues.

 The repository does not currently provide one production deployment

    manifest covering every service.

